<title>UK: Abbey National sets 125 mln stg pref shares.</title>
<headline>Abbey National sets 125 mln stg pref shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following preference share issue was announced by lead manager Goldman Sachs International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABBEY NATIONAL PLC</p>
<p> AMT    125 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    09.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+140 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER.</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS     1	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRITAIN   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.00 PCT GILT DUE 2021</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
